    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Business Outreach Agent v2\n\n**Flow:**\n1. Search Config → set niche, city, API keys\n2. Apify scrapes Google Maps (up to 50 businesses)\n3. Apollo.io looks up the OWNER's direct/mobile number\n4. Smart fallback: small biz (<30 reviews) = owner answers anyway\n5. Dedup against existing sheet rows\n6. AI scores lead and flags chains/franchises to skip\n7. Drop Cowboy sends ringless VM to the best available number\n8. Sheet updated with phone type, owner name, VM status\n\n**Credentials / Keys Needed:**\n- Apify API Token (replace in HTTP nodes)\n- Apollo.io API Key (add to Search Config)\n- Google Sheets OAuth2\n- OpenAI API Key\n- Drop Cowboy Token (replace in VM node)\n\n**Phone Type logic:**\n- Owner Mobile / Owner Direct → Apollo found their personal number\n- Owner-Operated (Business #) → <=30 reviews, owner answers\n- Business Line (Screened) → receptionist risk, stronger VM recommended",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0020-0020-0020-a1b2c3d40020",
      "name": "Setup Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [200, 120]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Apollo Enrichment\nSearches Apollo.io for the business\nowner by name + title + location.\n\nFinds mobile/direct numbers when\navailable (~40-60% hit rate for\nsmall US businesses).\n\nFree tier: 50 exports/month\nBasic plan: $49/mo for 1,000/mo",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 300,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0025-0025-0025-a1b2c3d40025",
      "name": "Apollo Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1620, 140]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## No New Leads\nAll scraped businesses already\nexist in your sheet.\n\nChange city or niche in\nSearch Config and re-run.",
        "height": 160,
        "width": 260,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0021-0021-0021-a1b2c3d40021",
      "name": "No New Leads Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [2860, 520]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AI Scoring\nGPT-4o-mini scores each lead and:\n- Uses owner name if Apollo found it\n- Adjusts hook based on phone type\n  (owner direct vs screened line)\n- Flags chains/franchises to skip\n- Generates personalized VM hook",
        "height": 180,
        "width": 300,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0022-0022-0022-a1b2c3d40022",
      "name": "AI Note",
